{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">特區政府在灣仔金紫荊廣場，舉行國慶77周年升旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">儀式早上8時舉行，現場奏唱國歌和行注目禮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG-0830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263e4UG4UBmt1790815189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG-0830_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>出席儀式的包括行政長官李家超，全國政協副主席梁振英、中聯辦主任周霽。以及多名特區政府官員、前行政長官曾蔭權和林鄭月娥、行政會議及立法會議員、各界代表及制服團隊成員等亦有出席升旗儀式。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防船、水警輪、政府飛行服務隊直升機，分別在海上和空中致意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG-0830_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cJKkvZyFOt1790815186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG-0830_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T01:19:02.905826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}